stateDiagram-v2
    state score_gate <<choice>>
    state fan_out <<fork>>
    state fan_in <<join>>

    [*] --> Collect
    Collect --> score_gate
    score_gate --> Reject : the score is under 0.5
    score_gate --> fan_out : the score is 0.5 or over
    fan_out --> Index
    fan_out --> Notify
    Index --> fan_in
    Notify --> fan_in
    fan_in --> Done
    Reject --> [*]
    Done --> [*]
